{"parentUuid":"f5e96746-6523-4d3f-abc9-ee846b02d23e","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"session_context","context":{"userEmail":"The user's email address is eric.rash11@gmail.com. Use it only to identify the user, such as for authorship, attribution, or filtering their own work. Never send it to an unrelated service, such as in a request header, URL, or payload, unless the user explicitly asks.","gitStatus":"This is the git status at the start of the conversation. Note that this status is a snapshot in time, and will not update during the conversation.\n\nCurrent branch: main\n\nMain branch (you will usually use this for PRs): main\n\nGit user: Eric Rash\n\nStatus:\n(clean)\n\nRecent commits:\nfef3876 docs: record Mac skill router enablement\nac87608 docs: record Claude hook repair\nb70e007 Merge pull request #4 from erash11/worktree-router+typesafe-sandbox\n2caca02 Router: Mac now has a key too\n780f048 Router: correct the TypeSafe key location, it is per-machine"}},"type":"attachment","uuid":"1d4d7cdf-93f3-497e-a950-93031ae48db2","timestamp":"2026-09-22T22:47:39.784Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nAs you answer the user's questions, you can use the following context:\n# userEmail\nThe user's email address is eric.rash11@gmail.com. Use it only to identify the user, such as for authorship, attribution, or filtering their own work. Never send it to an unrelated service, such as in a request header, URL, or payload, unless the user explicitly asks.\n# gitStatus\nThis is the git status at the start of the conversation. Note that this status is a snapshot in time, and will not update during the conversation.\n\nCurrent branch: main\n\nMain branch (you will usually use this for PRs): main\n\nGit user: Eric Rash\n\nStatus:\n(clean)\n\nRecent commits:\nfef3876 docs: record Mac skill router enablement\nac87608 docs: record Claude hook repair\nb70e007 Merge pull request #4 from erash11/worktree-router+typesafe-sandbox\n2caca02 Router: Mac now has a key too\n780f048 Router: correct the TypeSafe key location, it is per-machine\n\nIMPORTANT: this context may or may not be relevant to your tasks. You should not respond to this context unless it is highly relevant to your task.\n</system-reminder>"}],"session_id":"74f6814f-8ccf-42bc-aee0-c087dea07887","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"74f6814f-8ccf-42bc-aee0-c087dea07887","version":"2.1.280","gitBranch":"main"}
