{"parentUuid":"7b8b679e-5f6b-47ab-8d39-be0fd1d509b9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfKJDMwq18VDvZ1d2hPsf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Heads-up first:** one hook warning is still active. The memory compiler has 2 old logs that it has not processed yet. The fix is to run `compile.py`. One run costs about $1.28, so that is your decision.\n\n**DEV root:** `~/DEV`\n\n**What I did**\n- Pulled the 3 config repos:\n  - Config: 11 new commits.\n  - Skills: 9 new commits. The Codex copy now matches.\n  - Memory: 9 new commits. The newest is `bd166b1 closeout 2026-09-22`, from Windows.\n- The Mac and Windows copies of today's memory log were in conflict. I merged them so that the file keeps every line from both machines. No lines were lost.\n- Pulled 8 repos: the `~/DEV` root, `DataBase_GPS_Reporting`, `PlayCalls_SuccessRate_EPA`, `TOS_Evidence_Brief`, `TypeSafe_Sandbox` (31 commits), `PFF_Data_Project`, `SpringPlayerEvals_SymAnalysis` and `Life-OS`.\n- I did not clone or create any repos. `AI_Analyst` is not missing. It is parked in `_ARCHIVE`.\n- There were no repo conflicts, so I made no `.from-*` files.\n- 23 repos are active. 117 are dormant, and all of them are clean.\n\n**Result: clean.** All 145 folders are committed and match GitHub.\n\nWindows pushed new commits during this sync, a few minutes ago. If Windows is still in use, run `/dev-sync` again later.\n\n---\n\n```\nPicking up: Football/PFF_Data_Project (newest commit, today 17:39, from Windows)\nLast session: 2026-09-22, windows\nWhere things stand: The database no longer lives on Drive. Its path comes from $PFF_DB. The two machines now share data as Parquet files on Drive, and the Drive folder already has files.\nBlocked on: nothing. But STATUS.md is old. It still ends at 9/13 and does not record today's work.\nNext: load the Windows data on the Mac (`python scripts/load_snapshot.py --dry-run`, then run it without --dry-run), then do the weekly 2026 pull.\n```\n\n`$PFF_DB` is not set on the Mac. That is OK because `~/DEV` is not a Drive folder on the Mac, so the old `data/pff.db` path is safe to use.\n\nWhat do you want to do? Load the PFF data, or work on something else?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":688,"cache_read_input_tokens":90187,"output_tokens":913,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":80},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":688,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":913,"cache_read_input_tokens":90187,"cache_creation_input_tokens":688,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":688},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfKJDMQ65gua1NwtsK61K","attributionSkill":"dev-sync","type":"assistant","uuid":"7635caf2-6e58-4b5b-adf5-9c5b2c52054b","timestamp":"2026-09-22T22:51:58.752Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"74f6814f-8ccf-42bc-aee0-c087dea07887","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Football/PFF_Data_Project","sessionId":"74f6814f-8ccf-42bc-aee0-c087dea07887","version":"2.1.280","gitBranch":"main"}
