{"parentUuid":"4856161b-9dd4-4171-82af-57cff4e558cc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfKLQ8spLnPgm9zycDZuY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, it worked. Your load ran at 18:15, and the Mac database now matches the Windows data.\n\n**What I checked**\n- **Your load ran.** The database grew from 556 MB to 837 MB at 18:19. There is a backup from before the load: `data/pff_before_load_snapshot_20260922_181535.db`.\n- **Row counts match.** I ran the dry run again. All 22 files say `same`, for 2023 to 2026. That is 6.68 million rows.\n- **Contents match.** I compared 2026 one row at a time for `games`, `pff_grades` and `pff_premium`. There were 0 differences in each direction.\n\n**Two small notes**\n- Your plain `python3` does not have `duckdb`. I used `uv` in a temporary environment, and I installed nothing.\n- `docs/STATUS.md` does not record today's work yet. That is the database move off Drive and the new Parquet sharing between the machines. I can add it at closeout.\n\n**Next:** the weekly 2026 pull:\n`python scripts/pull_season_video_plays.py --season 2026 --refresh`"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":988,"cache_read_input_tokens":96741,"output_tokens":426,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":61},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":988,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":426,"cache_read_input_tokens":96741,"cache_creation_input_tokens":988,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":988},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfKLQ8L4u3mimovpVfDjG","type":"assi