#21). →`TypeSafe_Sandbox/docs/`\n- **PFF DB (9/22)**: 2026 thru wk3. Machines swap Parquet on Drive, never the DB: `load_snapshot.py` (Mac pending). →`PFF_Data_Project/docs/`\n\n## Environment Notes\n- Hooks: patch both copies only for shared events; Codex has no prompt-submit event. →Tier A hook-two-copies-trap.\n- daily-backup: manifest entries copy nothing alone; sweep nested `~/.claude` repos. →handoff 2026-09-19-backup-divergence-fix.\n- `DEV/Linda Projects` = private I-983 repo; folder has a space, repo an underscore.\n- `~/DEV` = THIN repo; `.gitignore` starts `/*` — never remove. →Tier A github-consolidation.\n- Win: `Desktop\\DEV` syncs via Drive (robocopy retired 9/22). No large DBs/junctions: renv via `RENV_PATHS_LIBRARY_ROOT`, PFF via `PFF_DB`. Stale `.git/worktrees`: read-only, then `Remove-Item -Force`.\n- Stack doctor: both machines. Schedules →automation-cadence. CFB capture →cfb-forecast-capture. Portfolio dashboard →command-centre.\n- **Mac TODO (9/22)**: `git pull` in `~/.claude/claude-memory-compiler` + `~/.claude/skills`, then delete this line.\n\n## Pending Decisions\n- **OKR gate (scored 9/14)**: AI integration buy-in + data governance (Anthony). Fold into NCAA charter or park?\n- **Kitman vs MyLink**: MyLink (~half cost) + Kitman API. Blocks priority 3.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":13,"oldLines":7,"newStart":13,"newLines":7,"lines":[" - **Sleep scheduler (9/16)**: R1 merged. NEXT: night/early-kickoff itineraries. →`sleep-scheduler/`"," - **RI5 #002 (9/21)**: v2 on Drive. NEXT: Eric sends `_v2` only."," - **TypeSafe (9/22)**: shadow gate log-only Win, review ~10/6; meeting→project tag shipped; spring traj failed. NEXT: Eric Y/Ns 22 surgeries (#21). →`TypeSafe_Sandbox/docs/`","-- **PFF DB (9/22)**: 2026 thru wk3. Machines swap Parquet on Drive, never the DB: `load_snapshot.py` (Mac pending). →`PFF_Data_Project/docs/`","+- **PFF DB (9/22)**: 2026 thru wk3. Machines swap Parquet on Drive, never the DB: Mac loaded. BUG: load wipes local-only premium rows (restored). No load/2024-25 export till fixed. →`PFF_Data_Project/docs/`"," "," ## Environment Notes"," - Hooks: patch both copies only for shared events; Codex has no prompt-submit event. →Tier A hook-two-copies-trap."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8545b51c-b82f-4572-9fed-d97383271d8a","session_id":"74f6814f-8ccf-42bc-aee0-c087dea07887","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"74f6814f-8ccf-42bc-aee0-c087dea07887","version":"2.1.280","gitBranch":"main"}
