{"parentUuid":"bda6a744-65b4-4a30-b258-7de0e0357ef1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"0aa7bf31-cb90-46db-810d-7f68a7e97430","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PkTh5TAeuFc93NsSpjBJtW","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/kristinarash/.claude/global-memory/MEMORY.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"8ed0858c-f247-410e-8e0b-6602716ba804","timestamp":"2026-09-22T23:26:12.845Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/kristinarash/.claude/global-memory/MEMORY.md","oldString":"Machines swap Parquet, not DB. BUG: load wipes local-only premium rows (restored 9/22); no load or 24-25 export till fixed.","newString":"Swap Parquet, not DB. BUG: load wipes local-only premium rows (restored); no load/24-25 export till fixed.","originalFile":"<!-- Cap: 2,500 chars. Working scratchpad; writes take effect next session. -->\n# Working Memory\n\n## Active Threads\n- **Prioritization slate (9/14)**: LIVE, 5/5 (Fall). →Tier A prioritization-slate\n- **Status report**: #3 by 9/25, biweekly to 12/18. →Tier A supervisor-log-pipeline\n- **Personal site (9/2)**: NEXT: phone check; host or local? →Tier A personal-site-build-routes\n- **RTP CLA (9/10)**: NEXT: .ris → Zotero; lesson 0002. →Tier A rtp-cla\n- **ATH Tech**: shipped; ITS pending; run 9/29. →Tier A tech-inventory-refresh\n- **Data pulls (9/21)**: Mac owns GPS/Perch/VALD (10:00-10:10, 16:30-16:40); Win writers off. →`DataBase_GPS_Reporting/docs/`\n- **FB matchups (9/13)**: EPA = PFF; CFBD PPA cross-check. TRAP: `run_direction` != point of attack\n- **PP Recruiting (9/22)**: 011 awaits Eric/staff; Jev pilot on draft PR #2, shadow only. →`PP_Recruiting/docs/`\n- **Sleep scheduler (9/16)**: R1 merged. NEXT: night/early-kickoff itineraries. →`sleep-scheduler/`\n- **RI5 #002 (9/21)**: v2 on Drive. NEXT: Eric sends `_v2` only.\n- **TypeSafe (9/22)**: shadow gate log-only Win, review ~10/6; meeting→project tag shipped; spring traj failed. NEXT: Eric Y/Ns 22 surgeries (#21). →`TypeSafe_Sandbox/docs/`\n- **PFF DB (9/22)**: Machines swap Parquet, not DB. BUG: load wipes local-only premium rows (restored 9/22); no load or 24-25 export till fixed. →`PFF_Data_Project/docs/`\n\n## Environment Notes\n- Hooks: patch both copies only for shared events; Codex has no prompt-submit event. →Tier A hook-two-copies-trap.\n- daily-backup: manifest entries copy nothing alone; sweep nested `~/.claude` repos. →handoff 2026-09-19-backup-divergence-fix.\n- `DEV/Linda Projects` = private I-983 repo; folder has a space, repo an underscore.\n- `~/DEV` = THIN repo; `.gitignore` starts `/*` — never remove. →Tier A github-consolidation.\n- Win: `Desktop\\DEV` syncs via Drive (robocopy retired 9/22). No large DBs/junctions: renv via `RENV_PATHS_LIBRARY_ROOT`, PFF via `PFF_DB`. Stale `.git/worktrees`: read-only, then `Remove-Item -Force`.\n- Stack doctor: both machines. Schedules →automation-cadence. CFB capture →cfb-forecast-capture. Portfolio dashboard →command-centre.\n- **Mac TODO (9/22)**: `git pull` in `~/.claude/claude-memory-compiler` + `~/.claude/skills`, then delete this line.\n\n## Pending Decisions\n- **OKR gate (scored 9/14)**: AI integration buy-in + data governance (Anthony). Fold into NCAA charter or park?\n- **Kitman vs MyLink**: MyLink (~half cost) + Kitman API. Blocks priority 3.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":13,"oldLines":7,"newStart":13,"newLines":7,"lines":[" - **Sleep scheduler (9/16)**: R1 merged. NEXT: night/early-kickoff itineraries. →`sleep-scheduler/`"," - **RI5 #002 (9/21)**: v2 on Drive. NEXT: Eric sends `_v2` only."," - **TypeSafe (9/22)**: shadow gate log-only Win, review ~10/6; meeting→project tag shipped; spring traj failed. NEXT: Eric Y/Ns 22 surgeries (#21). →`TypeSafe_Sandbox/docs/`","-- **PFF DB (9/22)**: Machines swap Parquet, not DB. BUG: load wipes local-only premium rows (restored 9/22); no load or 24-25 export till fixed. →`PFF_Data_Project/docs/`","+- **PFF DB (9/22)**: Swap Parquet, not DB. BUG: load wipes local-only premium rows (restored); no load/24-25 export till fixed. →`PFF_Data_Project/docs/`"," "," ## Environment Notes"," - Hooks: patch both copies only for shared events; Codex has no prompt-submit event. →Tier A hook-two-copies-trap."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"bda6a744-65b4-4a30-b258-7de0e0357ef1","session_id":"74f6814f-8ccf-42bc-aee0-c087dea07887","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"74f6814f-8ccf-42bc-aee0-c087dea07887","version":"2.1.280","gitBranch":"main"}
