board →command-centre."},"type":"attachment","uuid":"11786e4e-9a00-4d92-8d72-78f441364a70","timestamp":"2026-09-22T23:26:23.859Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nNote: /Users/kristinarash/.claude/global-memory/MEMORY.md changed on disk since you last read it. That's usually deliberate, so take it as the current state rather than reverting it; if the change looks wrong, say so rather than undoing it yourself — otherwise no need to call it out. Here are the relevant changes (shown with line numbers):\n8\t- **RTP CLA (9/10)**: NEXT: .ris → Zotero; lesson 0002. →Tier A rtp-cla\n9\t- **ATH Tech**: shipped; ITS pending; run 9/29. →Tier A tech-inventory-refresh\n10\t- **Data pulls (9/21)**: Mac owns GPS/Perch/VALD (10:00-10:10, 16:30-16:40); Win writers off. →`DataBase_GPS_Reporting/docs/`\n11\t- **FB matchups (9/13)**: EPA = PFF; CFBD PPA cross-check. TRAP: `run_direction` != point of attack\n12\t- **PP Recruiting (9/22)**: 011 awaits Eric/staff; Jev pilot on draft PR #2, shadow only. →`PP_Recruiting/docs/`\n13\t- **Sleep scheduler (9/16)**: R1 merged. NEXT: night/early-kickoff itineraries. →`sleep-scheduler/`\n14\t- **RI5 #002 (9/21)**: v2 on Drive. NEXT: Eric sends `_v2` only.\n15\t- **TypeSafe (9/22)**: shadow gate log-only Win, review ~10/6; meeting→project tag shipped; spring traj failed. NEXT: Eric Y/Ns 22 surgeries (#21). →`TypeSafe_Sandbox/docs/`\n16\t- **PFF DB (9/22)**: Swap Parquet, not DB. BUG: load wipes local-only premium (restored); no load/24-25 export yet. →`PFF_Data_Project/docs/`\n17\t\n18\t## Environment Notes\n19\t- Hooks: patch both copies only for shared events; Codex has no prompt-submit event. →Tier A hook-two-copies-trap.\n20\t- daily-backup: manifest entries copy nothing alone; sweep nested `~/.claude` repos. →handoff 2026-09-19-backup-divergence-fix.\n21\t- `DEV/Linda Projects` = private I-983 repo; folder has a space, repo an underscore.\n22\t- `~/DEV` = THIN repo; `.gitignore` starts `/*` — never remove. →Tier A github-consolidatio