{"parentUuid":"ea5bc166-a1fb-4bc7-a914-08f86e3a2a2b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfKLrCd1dFq2TY9sUv1tJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Closeout — 2026-09-22\n\n**First, a correction.** Earlier I said the load had \"worked\". That was wrong. The load did copy the Windows data correctly. But it also deleted 12,750 rows that only the Mac had: 2024–2025 `pff_premium` rows in `video_plays`, `team_play`, `quarterback_charting` and `rushing`. My first check missed this, because it only looked at 2026.\n\n**What I fixed:** I put all 12,750 rows back from the backup that the load made. Before that, I made a new backup: `data/pff_before_restore_premium_20260922.db`. Now 2024–2025 have the same row counts as before the load, and all of 2026 is there too. No other table lost rows.\n\n**Committed & pushed:**\n- `PFF_Data_Project`: STATUS and handoff.\n- `global-memory`: MEMORY.md, today's transcript and the docs harvest. Today's transcript was in conflict again. I merged it so that it keeps every line from both machines.\n- `~/.claude`: session files.\n- I also pulled 2 repos that Windows had updated: `TypeSafe_Sandbox` and `SpringPlayerEvals_SymAnalysis`.\n\n**STATUS.md:** updated in `~/DEV/Football/PFF_Data_Project/docs/STATUS.md`\n**Memory:** captured ✓. `.errors.log` is empty. MEMORY.md is 2,496 characters, under its 2,500 limit.\n**Handoff:** `~/DEV/Football/PFF_Data_Project/docs/handoffs/2026-09-22-mac-snapshot-load-restore.md`\n\n**Still open:**\n1. Fix `load_snapshot.py`. Now it replaces a whole season. It must replace one `pff_premium` category at a time, or stop when this machine has a category that the snapshot does not have.\n2. Until that fix is done:\n   - Do not load again on either machine.\n   - Do not export 2024 or 2025 from Windows. That would overwrite the Drive files without these rows.\n3. After the fix, export from the Mac so that Windows gets these rows:\n   `python scripts/export_snapshot.py --season 2024 --season 2025`\n\nClear to sign off."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1517,"cache_read_input_tokens":117906,"output_tokens":774,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":24},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1517,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":774,"cache_read_input_tokens":117906,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1517,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1517},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfKLrC2nygNVLjJJZuZQB","attributionSkill":"closeout","type":"assistant","uuid":"71398b26-5abb-4428-b4a4-e33f77ed5ce4","timestamp":"2026-09-22T23:27:09.090Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"74f6814f-8ccf-42bc-aee0-c087dea07887","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"74f6814f-8ccf-42bc-aee0-c087dea07887","version":"2.1.280","gitBranch":"main"}
