{"parentUuid":"4e15ca41-27e6-456f-8ec7-f52de21a0276","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfKM4GocdWSVQ2gSbR5VL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Su36fg5tELvZUPHunbEVkw","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd ~/DEV/Football/PFF_Data_Project && git add scripts/load_snapshot.py tests/test_snapshot.py CLAUDE.md AGENTS.md docs/STATUS.md && git commit -qm \"snapshots: load merges by primary key and never deletes local rows\n\nThe old load deleted each season, then inserted the snapshot. On 2026-09-22 that\nerased 12,750 Mac-only pff_premium rows (2024-2025 video_plays, team_play,\nquarterback_charting, rushing) that Windows had never pulled. They were restored\nfrom the pre-load backup. The dry run now reports rows added and local-only rows kept.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CDKL8YRUjGwHRoKNZvRUZs\" && git push -q -u origin fix/load-snapshot-keeps-local-rows 2>&1 | tail -1 && gh pr create --title \"snapshots: load never deletes local rows\" --body \"The load deleted each season, then inserted the snapshot. On 2026-09-22 it erased 12,750 Mac-only \\`pff_premium\\` rows (restored from backup the same night).\n\n- Load now merges by primary key: add new rows, replace matching ones, delete nothing.\n- Dry run reports rows added and local-only rows kept. On the real Mac DB: keeps 6,483 (2024) and 6,267 (2025).\n- Manifest row check kept, now read from the Parquet file.\n- New test: \\`test_load_keeps_local_rows_the_snapshot_lacks\\`. 50/50 pass.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CDKL8YRUjGwHRoKNZvRUZs\" 2>&1 | tail -1","description":"Commit the fix, push branch, open PR"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2144